  "shortDescription": "WING IT! is an open movie, made entirely with Blender. Get the production files, assets and exclusive making-of videos by joining Blender Studio at https://studio.blender.org/wing-it\n\n--\n\nAn uptight engineer gets an unwelcome visit from a enthusiastic wannabe-pilot, causing both of them to be launched into the air inside an out-of-control space shuttle.\n\nBlender Studio is the creative part of the Blender. A dedicated team of artists and developers challenge themselves with creative-technical targets to help Blender users and to drive Blender development forward. This happens in an open source production environment and by sharing everything they make in an open and free license.\n\nWant to know more? Join the studio today and help the team to create & share. https://studio.blender.org/",
